{"step_index":997,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-07T20:49:22Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Red 2D Flat Vectorial Interactiva del Ecosistema de Kennedy - Corabastos - Zona Franca con fondo blanco puro (#FFFFFF), círculos planos de relleno sólido pastel sin gradiente 3D ni sombras, con arcos conectores limpios y paneles concéntricos radiales calcados del referente visual.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Ecosistema Radial Flat: Kennedy - Corabastos - Zona Franca</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    body, html {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      color: #1e293b;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      user-select: none;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    #viewport {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      display: block;\n      cursor: default;\n    }\n\n    .glass-panel {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n    }\n\n    .top-header {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 16px;\n      left: 16px;\n      right: 16px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 100;\n    }\n\n    .brand-title {\n      padding: 10px 18px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n      color: #0f172a;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n    }\n\n    .nav-group {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n    }\n\n    .btn-flat {\n      background: #f1f5f9;\n      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n      color: #334155;\n      padding: 8px 14px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      font-size: 11.5px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      transition: all 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    .btn-flat:hover {\n      background: #e2e8f0;\n      color: #0f172a;\n    }\n\n    /* Inspector Popup Drawer */\n    .node-inspector {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 70px;\n      right: 16px;\n      width: 360px;\n      max-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 18px;\n      z-index: 120;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .node-title {\n      font-size: 14.5px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #0f172a;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n\n    .node-subtitle {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      color: #64748b;\n      font-family: monospace;\n      margin-top: 3px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .btn-close {\n      width: 24px;\n      height: 24px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #f1f5f9;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #475569;\n    }\n    .btn-close:hover {\n      background: #e2e8f0;\n      color: #0f172a;\n    }\n\n    .text-content {\n      background: #f8fafc;\n      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      color: #334155;\n      font-size: 11.5px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .citation-box {\n      background: rgba(132, 164, 139, 0.12);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(132, 164, 139, 0.35);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      color: #2e5a36;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n      font-style: italic;\n    }\n\n    .bottom-bar {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 16px;\n      left: 16px;\n      right: 16px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 100;\n    }\n\n    .status-badge {\n      padding: 8px 16px;\n      color: #475569;\n      font-size: 10.5px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n    }\n    .status-badge b {\n      color: #0f172a;\n      font-family: monospace;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <canvas id=\"viewport\"></canvas>\n\n  <div class=\"top-header\">\n    <div class=\"glass-panel brand-title\">\n      <span>🚥 ECOSISTEMA RADIAL FLAT: KENNEDY - CORABASTOS - ZONA FRANCA</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nav-group\">\n      <button class=\"btn-flat\" onclick=\"resetZoom()\">Restablecer Vista</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"glass-panel node-inspector\" id=\"nodeInspector\" style=\"display:none;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom:8px;\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"node-title\" id=\"mNodeTitle\">Título Nodo</div>\n        <div class=\"node-subtitle\" id=\"mNodeCategory\">Categoría Radial</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"btn-close\" onclick=\"closeInspector()\">×</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#64748b; font-weight:800;\">Función Operativa en la Red</div>\n    <div class=\"text-content\" id=\"mNodeDesc\">Descripción.</div>\n\n    <div style=\"font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#64748b; font-weight:800;\">📜 Cita Técnica Oficial</div>\n    <div class=\"citation-box\" id=\"mNodeCitation\">Cita.</div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:flex-end; margin-top:6px;\">\n      <button class=\"btn-flat\" onclick=\"closeInspector()\">Cerrar</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-bar\">\n    <div class=\"glass-panel status-badge\">\n      Anillos Radiales Flat: <b>Públicos / Macro • Hub Logístico Fontibón • Arterias Kennedy • Núcleo Corabastos</b>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"glass-panel status-badge\">\n      💡 Diseño Flat Vectorial 2D sin 3D ni sombras • Clic en nodos para interactuar\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('viewport');\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n    let scale = 1.0, targetScale = 1.0;\n    let panX = 0, panY = 0, targetPanX = 0, targetPanY = 0;\n    let isMouseDown = false, lastX = 0, lastY = 0, clickStartX = 0, clickStartY = 0;\n    let hoveredNode = null, selectedNode = null;\n\n    // Paleta de colores FLAT pastel exacta de la infografía\n    const palette = {\n      bg: '#ffffff',\n      ringLine: 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06)',\n      edgeLine: 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12)',\n      edgeActive: '#0284c7',\n      clusters: {\n        core: { fill: '#FFF3CD', stroke: '#E6C200', text: '#856404' },\n        macro: { fill: '#FAD0C4', stroke: '#E8A598', text: '#721C24' },\n        hub: { fill: '#E2D4F0', stroke: '#BEA6DE', text: '#38124D' },\n        arterias: { fill: '#D0E1FD', stroke: '#9EC2FC', text: '#004085' },\n        corabastos: { fill: '#D4EDDA', stroke: '#9BD4A7', text: '#155724' }\n      }\n    };\n\n    // Dataset adaptado a disposición 2D FLAT RADIAL (Anillos concéntricos idénticos al plano)\n    const rawNodesData = [\n      // NODO CENTRO\n      { id: 'CORE', label: 'Ecosistema Agroalimentario & Logístico', category: 'Núcleo Central', cluster: 'core', desc: 'Centro neurálgico de abastecimiento alimentario y redistribución logística del Borde Occidental de Bogotá D.C.', citation: 'POT Decreto 555 de 2021 - Actuación Estratégica Chucua de la Vaca.', radius: 52, angle: 0, dist: 0 },\n\n      // NIVEL 1: PÚBLICOS / MACRO REGIONAL (Arriba - Tono Rosa Pastel)\n      { id: 'REG_MAIN', label: 'Región Central & Accesos', category: 'Macro Regional', cluster: 'macro', desc: 'Proveedor primario de carga agrícola e insumos pecuarios procesados en tractocamiones pesados C3-S3.', citation: 'SDM (2019) Estudio Origen-Destino de Carga.', radius: 36, angle: -Math.PI / 2, dist: 190 },\n      { id: 'REG_CALLE13', label: 'Corredor Calle 13 / Autosur', category: 'Macro Regional', cluster: 'macro', desc: 'Punto de ingreso del 68% de los alimentos de la capital.', citation: 'Decreto 319 de 2006 (Plan Maestro).', radius: 26, angle: -Math.PI / 2 - 0.35, dist: 280 },\n      { id: 'REG_PRODUCT', label: 'Boyacá / Meta / Tolima', category: 'Macro Regional', cluster: 'macro', desc: 'Despacho de alimentos perecederos y grano seco.', citation: 'SDDE & CCB (2021).', radius: 24, angle: -Math.PI / 2 + 0.35, dist: 280 },\n\n      // NIVEL 2: HUB LOGÍSTICO FONTIBÓN (Derecha Arriba - Tono Violeta Pastel)\n      { id: 'LOG_MAIN', label: 'Cluster Zona Franca Bogotá', category: 'Hub Logístico', cluster: 'hub', desc: 'Hub de empaques, secos, mercancía industrializada de importación e intermediación.', citation: 'SDDE & CCB (2021).', radius: 36, angle: -Math.PI / 6, dist: 200 },\n      { id: 'LOG_CENTENARIO', label: 'Av. Centenario ⇄ Av. Cali', category: 'Hub Logístico', cluster: 'hub', desc: 'Corredor de conexión pesada bidireccional entre Fontibón y Kennedy.', citation: 'SDM (2022) Flujos Logísticos.', radius: 26, angle: -Math.PI / 6 - 0.25, dist: 290 },\n      { id: 'LOG_EMPAQUES', label: 'Procesamiento Secos & Empaques', category: 'Hub Logístico', cluster: 'hub', desc: 'Suministro de empaques plásticos y costalería para Corabastos.', citation: 'SDDE (2021) Logística Urbana.', radius: 24, angle: -Math.PI / 6 + 0.25, dist: 290 },\n\n      // NIVEL 3: ARTERIAS URBANAS KENNEDY (Derecha Abajo - Tono Azul Celeste Pastel)\n      { id: 'URB_MAIN', label: 'Arterias Urbanas Kennedy', category: 'Arterias Distritales', cluster: 'arterias', desc: 'Malla vial colectora y distribuidora distrital.', citation: 'IDU (2021) Capacidad Operativa en Kennedy.', radius: 36, angle: Math.PI / 4, dist: 200 },\n      { id: 'URB_AMERICAS', label: 'Nodo Banderas / Av. Américas', category: 'Arterias Distritales', cluster: 'arterias', desc: 'Confluencia de rutas troncales de TransMilenio, alimentadores y camiones.', citation: 'IDU (2021).', radius: 26, angle: Math.PI / 4 - 0.25, dist: 290 },\n      { id: 'URB_TINTAL', label: 'Corredor Av. Tintal / Av. Cepeda', category: 'Arterias Distritales', cluster: 'arterias', desc: 'Vía afectada por retención en cola (Spillback) de 3 km.', citation: 'SDM (2020) PMT Patio Bonito.', radius: 26, angle: Math.PI / 4 + 0.25, dist: 290 },\n\n      // NIVEL 4: NÚCLEO HIPERLOCAL CORABASTOS (Izquierda Abajo - Tono Verde Menta Pastel)\n      { id: 'CORE_MAIN', label: 'Central Mayorista Corabastos', category: 'Núcleo Hiperlocal', cluster: 'corabastos', desc: 'Punto de recepción y comercialización final de carga agroalimentaria.', citation: 'Resolución SDM 184 de 2018.', radius: 36, angle: Math.PI * 3 / 4, dist: 200 },\n      { id: 'CORE_PUERTAS', label: 'Básculas Puertas 6, 7 y 8', category: 'Núcleo Hiperlocal', cluster: 'corabastos', desc: 'Embudos de pesaje que originan la cola de retención exterior.', citation: 'POT Decreto 555 de 2021.', radius: 26, angle: Math.PI * 3 / 4 - 0.25, dist: 290 },\n      { id: 'CORE_MALLA', label: 'Malla Local Peri-Corabastos', category: 'Núcleo Hiperlocal', cluster: 'corabastos', desc: 'Velocidad < 5 km/h por parqueo informal y bicipatines cargadores.', citation: 'Corabastos S.A. & SDM (2018).', radius: 26, angle: Math.PI * 3 / 4 + 0.25, dist: 290 }\n    ];\n\n    const edges = [\n      { source: 'CORE', target: 'REG_MAIN' },\n      { source: 'CORE', target: 'LOG_MAIN' },\n      { source: 'CORE', target: 'URB_MAIN' },\n      { source: 'CORE', target: 'CORE_MAIN' },\n\n      { source: 'REG_MAIN', target: 'REG_CALLE13' },\n      { source: 'REG_MAIN', target: 'REG_PRODUCT' },\n\n      { source: 'LOG_MAIN', target: 'LOG_CENTENARIO' },\n      { source: 'LOG_MAIN', target: 'LOG_EMPAQUES' },\n\n      { source: 'URB_MAIN', target: 'URB_AMERICAS' },\n      { source: 'URB_MAIN', target: 'URB_TINTAL' },\n\n      { source: 'CORE_MAIN', target: 'CORE_PUERTAS' },\n      { source: 'CORE_MAIN', target: 'CORE_MALLA' },\n\n      // Intersecciones transversales\n      { source: 'LOG_MAIN', target: 'CORE_MAIN' },\n      { source: 'REG_MAIN', target: 'LOG_MAIN' },\n      { source: 'URB_MAIN', target: 'CORE_MAIN' },\n      { source: 'CORE_PUERTAS', target: 'URB_TINTAL' }\n    ];\n\n    let nodes = [];\n\n    function resize() {\n      canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n      canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n    }\n    window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n    resize();\n\n    function initTopology() {\n      const nodeMap = new Map();\n      nodes = rawNodesData.map((d, idx) => {\n        const x = Math.cos(d.angle) * d.dist;\n        const y = Math.sin(d.angle) * d.dist;\n        const n = { ...d, nodeId: idx, x, y };\n        nodeMap.set(d.id, n);\n        return n;\n      });\n\n      edges.forEach(e => {\n        e.sourceNode = nodeMap.get(e.source);\n        e.targetNode = nodeMap.get(e.target);\n      });\n    }\n\n    function resetZoom() {\n      targetScale = 1.0; targetPanX = 0; targetPanY = 0;\n    }\n\n    function openInspector(node) {\n      selectedNode = node;\n      document.getElementById('mNodeTitle').innerText = node.label;\n      document.getElementById('mNodeCategory').innerText = `Cluster: ${node.category}`;\n      document.getElementById('mNodeDesc').innerText = node.desc;\n      document.getElementById('mNodeCitation').innerText = node.citation;\n      document.getElementById('nodeInspector').style.display = 'flex';\n    }\n\n    function closeInspector() {\n      selectedNode = null;\n      document.getElementById('nodeInspector').style.display = 'none';\n    }\n\n    function render() {\n      const w = canvas.width, h = canvas.height;\n      const cx = w / 2 + panX;\n      const cy = h / 2 + panY;\n\n      scale += (targetScale - scale) * 0.12;\n      panX += (targetPanX - panX) * 0.12;\n      panY += (targetPanY - panY) * 0.12;\n\n      // 1. Fondo Blanco Puro\n      ctx.fillStyle = palette.bg;\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.translate(cx, cy);\n      ctx.scale(scale, scale);\n\n      // 2. Anillos Concéntricos Flat de Fondo (Guias Radiales)\n      [190, 280, 360].forEach(r => {\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(0, 0, r, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.strokeStyle = palette.ringLine;\n        ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n        ctx.setLineDash([4, 4]);\n        ctx.stroke();\n        ctx.setLineDash([]);\n      });\n\n      // 3. Render Edges (Líneas de Conexión Flat Limpias)\n      edges.forEach(e => {\n        const s = e.sourceNode, t = e.targetNode;\n        if (!s || !t) return;\n\n        const isHov = hoveredNode && (s.id === hoveredNode.id || t.id === hoveredNode.id);\n        const isSel = selectedNode && (s.id === selectedNode.id || t.id === selectedNode.id);\n\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.moveTo(s.x, s.y);\n        ctx.lineTo(t.x, t.y);\n        ctx.strokeStyle = (isHov || isSel) ? palette.edgeActive : palette.edgeLine;\n        ctx.lineWidth = (isHov || isSel) ? 2.5 : 1.2;\n        ctx.stroke();\n        ctx.restore();\n      });\n\n      // 4. Render Nodos Círculos Flat Sólidos Pastel (Sin Gradientes 3D)\n      nodes.forEach(n => {\n        const isHov = hoveredNode && hoveredNode.id === n.id;\n        const isSel = selectedNode && selectedNode.id === n.id;\n        const cStyle = palette.clusters[n.cluster] || palette.clusters.core;\n\n        ctx.save();\n\n        // Relleno Sólido Flat Pastel\n        ctx.fillStyle = cStyle.fill;\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(n.x, n.y, n.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.fill();\n\n        // Borde Vectorial Limpio\n        ctx.strokeStyle = (isHov || isSel) ? '#0f172a' : cStyle.stroke;\n        ctx.lineWidth = (isHov || isSel) ? 3 : 1.8;\n        ctx.stroke();\n\n        // Texto Integrado Dentro o Debajo del Nodo\n        ctx.font = (isHov || isSel) ? 'bold 11px sans-serif' : '10px sans-serif';\n        ctx.fillStyle = cStyle.text;\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n        ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n\n        // Wrap label text inside circle if it's large, or underneath\n        if (n.radius >= 36) {\n          const words = n.label.split(' ');\n          if (words.length > 2) {\n            ctx.fillText(words.slice(0, 2).join(' '), n.x, n.y - 6);\n            ctx.fillText(words.slice(2).join(' '), n.x, n.y + 8);\n          } else {\n            ctx.fillText(n.label, n.x, n.y);\n          }\n        } else {\n          ctx.fillText(n.label, n.x, n.y + n.radius + 12);\n        }\n\n        ctx.restore();\n      });\n\n      ctx.restore();\n\n      requestAnimationFrame(render);\n    }\n\n    // Controls\n    canvas.addEventListener('mousedown', e => {\n      isMouseDown = true;\n      lastX = e.clientX; lastY = e.clientY;\n      clickStartX = e.clientX; clickStartY = e.clientY;\n    });\n\n    window.addEventListener('mouseup', e => {\n      isMouseDown = false;\n      const dragDist = Math.hypot(e.clientX - clickStartX, e.clientY - clickStartY);\n      if (dragDist < 5 && hoveredNode) {\n        openInspector(hoveredNode);\n      }\n    });\n\n    canvas.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {\n      if (isMouseDown) {\n        targetPanX += e.clientX - lastX;\n        targetPanY += e.clientY - lastY;\n        lastX = e.clientX; lastY = e.clientY;\n      } else {\n        const w = canvas.width, h = canvas.height;\n        const cx = w / 2 + panX;\n        const cy = h / 2 + panY;\n        const mx = (e.clientX - cx) / scale;\n        const my = (e.clientY - cy) / scale;\n\n        let closest = null, minDist = 40;\n        nodes.forEach(n => {\n          const d = Math.hypot(n.x - mx, n.y - my);\n          if (d < minDist) { minDist = d; closest = n; }\n        });\n        hoveredNode = closest;\n      }\n    });\n\n    canvas.addEventListener('wheel', e => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const zoomFactor = e.deltaY < 0 ? 1.08 : 0.92;\n      targetScale = Math.max(0.5, Math.min(2.5, targetScale * zoomFactor));\n    }, { passive: false });\n\n    initTopology();\n    requestAnimationFrame(render);\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Red 2D Flat Vectorial Interactiva del Ecosistema de Movilidad de Kennedy con fondo blanco puro (#FFFFFF), círculos planos de relleno sólido pastel sin efectos 3D ni esferas, con las mismas intersecciones del referente visual.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\aleja\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\d3de736b-bad3-4cd4-b3f7-8b59f3dfee52\\red_ecosistema_kennedy.html","toolAction":"Converting Kennedy network to pure 2D Flat Vectorial with pastel colors","toolSummary":"Convert Kennedy network to pure 2D Flat Vectorial"}}]}
